<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Interview Guide</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Main impressions of the tool? What did you like or dislike about the tool?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Was there any point you felt stuck</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How could the tool have been more helpful to you? Did you wish anything was different / added / removed?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">What were your impressions of the virtual agent delivering this material?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As a counselor, do you imagine this authoring tool could be useful in your health education conversations? How?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Do you feel this virtual agent delivery method may be helpful to you? In what circumstances?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How clear / understandable / actionable did you feel the information ended up to be?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Would you feel comfortable relying on a similar system for other health education topics?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Were the smart suggestions impacting you in any way? How? What did you like/dislike about the AI suggestions?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Did you trust the information provided by the AI?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i11" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">How easy was it to use the AI in the tool?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i12" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Did you feel the AI was hurting the process in any way?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i13" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i13.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i13.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Did you have a particular group of patients in mind when designing the conversation? How relevant was the final conversation to that group, in your opinion?</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
